WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.320
I'm getting really nervous.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.530
Why's that, Koharu-chan?

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:14.610
Seriously?

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:19.040
No, I get you. We're only five days from the Final Tournament.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.410
Exactly!

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:25.540
In the Final Tournament, your place in the original ranking no longer matters.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:31.460
You'll draw lots to determine a bracket, 
and the winners proceed to the Final Stage.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.510
Have the pairings been drawn yet?

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.640
They will soon.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.800
It'll be broadcast here.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.520
"Aikatsu Ranking: Last-Minute Live"?

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:46.020
In two days, there'll be the bracket drawings and time for us to appeal to the viewers.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.980
They said it'll be broadcast internationally.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.530
That gets me going!

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:54.950
The Final Tournament will be decided by audience votes.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:59.830
This is the last chance we'll get to let our feelings be known.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.490
You'll have to make it count.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.120
I can't contain my excitement!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.960
Let's do our best, Mahiru-chan.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.000
Of course!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.090
We should get started right away!

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.080
Thanks for the treat!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:07.580
Kirara, Aria.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.910
Rei-chan, hello!

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:11.580
Good afternoon!

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.460
I can't find the other students anywhere.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.050
Have you seen them?

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.460
N-No?

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:24.470
I hope I'm mistaken, but you're not hiding anything from me, are you?

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.480
I tried to stop them too.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.600
But I understand how they feel.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:35.610
Anyone would feel the same 
hearing we're gonna shut down.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.940
Everyone must feel uneasy.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:41.490
But that's no reason to leave...

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:42.700
We must stop them.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.950
You're right! Let's try convincing them again!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.490
I'll help out too!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.620
I apologize for the sudden summons.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.210
There's just one thing I want to confirm.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:00.630
If you're considering leaving Venus Ark, please be honest and raise your hand.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:07.850
Why?

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.640
It's Elza-sama.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.850
We can't believe it was all to get her Sun Dress.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.610
She was using us this whole time.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.980
That includes you too, Rei-san! {this sounds like Mei-san}{everything sounds like everything else, human speech isn't that varied}{don't you semantic my phoneme}

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:21.280
The school's even shutting down...

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.200
We can't stay here.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.200
I won't allow it to be closed!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.950
Please believe in Elza. She will definitely return!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:33.040
That's why I want to make a place for her to come back to.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.330
And to do that, I need every single one of you!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.460
Even if you say that...

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.840
I can't believe in her.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.180
Thank you for today!

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.180
Rei-san.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.100
Rei-san.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.810
Are you here for work?

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:59.820
Hey, Mahiru. I just got here a bit early.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.860
Has something happened?

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:07.200
Venus Ark may be falling apart.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.830
So it really is closing down.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.580
I won't let it!

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.790
Elza was always our shining light.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:17.080
But right now...

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.000
In that case, you just need to become that light.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.710
Me? I couldn't...

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.670
You can do it.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:30.810
You know how important it is to keep pressing onward, 
as well as how much of a struggle it is.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.970
Mahiru, you...

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:36.560
That's why you can understand their feelings of doubt better than anyone.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.230
Don't you think?

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.940
Your passion will get through to them.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.610
Your light is every bit as strong as Elza-san's.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.410
Thank you, Mahiru.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.410
Take one.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.750
Girls, let's all have a lesson together!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:02.250
Rei-san will be giving an original modeling lesson too!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.670
Kirara will be there too!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:08.680
<i>What can I do for them?</i>

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.720
<i>This is all I can think of for now.</i>

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:16.390
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.030
You can do it, Yume-senpai!

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.940
Thank you!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.150
Yume!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:31.870
There's only half an hour until filming for your song show!

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.950
That's thirty whole minutes! Could you remind me at the last possible minute?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.960
Honestly...

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:40.460
All right, I'll take care of it.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:41.670
Thanks!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.880
Keep at it, Yume!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.210
Rola-senpai.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:50.180
Well, we all worked together to make this for Yume-senpai.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.310
I hope they come soon!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.560
I'm excited! I'm very excited!

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.560
Okay, we're all set now.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.150
Nobody came...

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.820
How unfortunate.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.860
Well, it's not like I didn't see this coming.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.870
Please, come to our lesson!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.160
Please come!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.250
Hey, did you go to Rei-san's lesson?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.080
I <i>did</i> think about it...

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.670
Why again?!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:27.510
They all said they wanted to Aikatsu!

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.800
I'm very shocked.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.090
Light, huh.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:36.180
I was just thinking how hard it is to move hearts.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:41.640
It's exceedingly difficult to unite a group and give them direction.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:46.440
It truly was amazing how Elza could do it so perfectly.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.610
Yeah!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.610
Yes!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.950
Wait! Isn't tomorrow the Last-Minute Live?{this is a lyger hyphen so it can either way, but we should the same way each time}{my miss}

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.070
Did you remember to prepare?

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:54.950
Yeah.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:58.200
But right now, the students are more important.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.450
Rei-chan.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:05.920
I don't need much time. If only they would Aikatsu with me, I'm sure I could unite us.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:13.130
Aw man, it's already locked.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.590
Is this what you're looking for?

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.220
Rola! How'd you know?

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.520
How long do you think we've known each other?

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.770
I'll get the lights.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:26.610
Okay.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:30.650
Thanks, Rola.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.410
Wow! It's a thousand cranes!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.910
Where'd this come from?

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.370
The first-years made it. Do you like it?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.420
Yeah!

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.670
Win it, Yume.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:50.460
I will.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:57.180
It's a competition. When one person wins, another loses.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:02.560
But there are some things you'll never learn about yourself unless you lose.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:05.690
I'm sure it's the same for Elza-san.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.940
For Elza-san?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:13.190
You climbed your way here, so it's your responsibility to teach her.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.820
Okay. I'll win.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.740
No matter what.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:35.050
Thank you all for gathering on this fine day!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:40.930
I will be your host this year! My name is Tsuji!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.270
Yume!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.770
What? Where's Rei-san?

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:52.110
Also, as I'm sure you've noticed,

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:55.740
Kizaki Rei-san is unfortunately unable to join us today.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:10:02.910
As we are broadcasting this drawing for the 
bracket live, we must proceed even without her.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.070
Rei-san's not there?!

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.450
But why?

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.660
On such an important day...

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.250
She wouldn't!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.250
I knew it...

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.880
Even though nobody's ever shown up...

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.300
Why?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.760
But someone might show up today.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.260
That's what she's waiting for!

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:24.310
Rei-san understands how important today is.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:29.350
But she cares more about Venus Ark, and about all of you.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.900
I hope everyone enjoyed the 
contestants' passionate appeals.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:41.490
Now then, we also have a video from Kizaki Rei-san that we'd like to play.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:45.540
I sincerely apologize for my absence today.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.790
I do not blame you if you think I'm not taking this fight seriously.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:53.790
However, there is something I must accomplish first.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:58.760
Even if it's unlikely to succeed, I can't afford to give up.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:02.050
I will not allow Venus Ark to close down!

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:03.970
Rei.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.640
Let's give her a round of applause!

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:12.060
Next up is the drawing for the Final Tournament!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.060
Wait.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.860
Someone who has abandoned us today has no right to participate.

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:16.940
Elza-san!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:21.950
Rei has disappointed me with her foolish actions.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.820
She isn't foolish!

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:26.370
Please take back what you said.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:30.080
You understand what's going on, don't you?

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.830
I'm begging you!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:36.840
Please try to understand Rei-chan's earnest feelings!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.420
Please!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.340
Please, Elza-san.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.840
Mahiru-chan.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.600
I'm asking as well.

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:53.230
I'll end up winning regardless. Do whatever you wish.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.230
Yes!

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:03.490
Now then, we'll have these three draw their own lots, and whatever remains will go to Kizaki-san.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:07.620
Okay, the bracket for the Final Tournament has been decided!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.740
Let's take a look!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:15.630
I just can't believe in Elza-sama.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.380
It was a mistake to come to Venus Ark!

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:20.920
That's not true!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.590
Rei-chan!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:27.390
It was Elza's radiance that drew you here.{70% sure this hazu is a "this is true right? so my next statement is also true" hazu}{right}

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:32.390
You wanted to reach her. With that in mind, 
you strove for greater heights.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:37.270
Elza caused you to grow. 
Just as she did with me.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.110
Or are you saying that never happened?

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.650
No, that would be impossible.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.070
Please watch my performance.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:49.160
I'll become your ray of light at the Final Tournament!

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:56.750
It's finally time to draw the curtains on the Aikatsu Ranking Final Tournament!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:01.670
This tournament is being broadcast worldwide.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:06.840
Let's begin the Aikatsu Ranking Final Tournament First Stage!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:12.270
Four Star Academy's Nijino Yume-san versus Venus Ark's Kizaki Rei-san!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:15.390
Their intense battle is about to start!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:21.860
Thank you for convincing Elza the other day.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:22.530
It wasn't me.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.030
Mahiru-chan was the one who did it.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.240
I see.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.950
I like the look in your eyes.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.700
Same goes for you.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:33.500
Let's fight to the best of our ability.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.500
Right!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.500
<i>I'll shoulder their feelings and illuminate their path! {yeah, I was on a light high and shouldn't've reused this}</i>

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:46.050
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.530
Dresses can make everyone shine!

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:52.780
<i>Nijino Yume, you're a mystery.</i>

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.490
<i>Could you always shine so brightly?</i>

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.790
<i>But I must surpass her.</i>

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.540
<i>I will become their light!{you can yours but}</i>

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.250
Kizaki Rei—Everything is for Elza!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.860
Here we go, this time with a flourish!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.760
Rei-chan is so gallant!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:09.640
I'm touched! I'm very touched!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:17.820
Both performances were an emotional express!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:21.150
Now then, let's tally up the votes!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.250
There we have it!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:41.090
The winner of the First Stage is Nijino Yume-san!

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.010
Thank you all so much!

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:46.890
Nijino Yume-san will progress to the Final Stage!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.100
Rei-chan...

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.020
Rei-san!

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:00.610
Hey, Yume.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:02.780
Um...

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.280
Congratulations, Yume.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.820
That was a fantastic performance.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:10.290
Thank you.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:13.910
I have no regrets... is what I'd like to say.

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:17.170
I bet everything on that stage.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.210
Rei-chan!

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.550
Kirara, Aria...

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:25.550
I'm sorry. I couldn't become your light.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:27.640
Please don't...

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.350
Don't say that!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:33.770
Girls...

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:36.560
Rei-san, you're our light.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.400
But, I...

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:43.070
You may have lost the tournament, but still...

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.400
You were so radiant.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:48.450
We want to be more like you.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.660
That's why we've decided to remain at Venus Ark.

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.460
You're their ray of light.{if this is what you were trying to do, this should}{but... it's funny. Mahiru just fucked me}

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:59.580
Their sword of light that cuts open a path.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.630
That describes you best, Rei-san.

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:06.010
I see.

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:09.050
Thank you.

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:11.640
Rei-chan!

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:13.390
You're very lovely.

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:23.860
<i>I'm up next.</i>

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.870
Royal Sword is a brand made for Elza.

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:02.580
But the light of my Aikatsu was unable to reach her.

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:05.500
Your stage was overflowing with light.

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:08.590
Thank you. Work hard for me as well.

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:13.470
No matter how many tiles I break and break...!

00:24:13.470 --> 00:24:16.550
Mahiru-chan is acting strange before her battle with Elza-san?

00:24:16.550 --> 00:24:18.680
I don't know what to think!

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:20.520
Next time on Aikatsu Stars! {fuck yes they're back}

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:22.020
Mahiru's Radiance. {definitely a pun}

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.350
Become the first-star idol!
